        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ruth Johnson, Dick DeVos, Jennifer Granholm\n- Events: Michigan Secretary of State election, 2014; 2006 Michigan gubernatorial election\n- Places: Michigan\n\nFacts:\n- Ruth Johnson was the incumbent Republican Secretary of State who was re-elected in the 2014 Michigan Secretary of State election.\n- Dick DeVos is a Democratic entrepreneur, businessman, and author from Michigan.\n- Ruth Johnson was the running mate of Dick DeVos in the 2006 Michigan gubernatorial election.\n- Jennifer Granholm, the incumbent Governor of Michigan, defeated Dick DeVos and Ruth Johnson in the 2006 Michigan gubernatorial election.",
